OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHow a folk band, football club and Fifa
OL,4,A11 came together for an unlikely
OL,5,Aterrace anthem
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's a strange musical connection that
OL,8,Fcame about in a way avid fans of sports
OL,9,Fvideo games can understand - via Fifa
OL,10,F11, a game the band said they started
OL,11,Fplaying while recording their second
OL,12,Falbum.
OL,14,FThe band adopted Wycombe Wanderers as
OL,15,Ftheir team in the game and eventually
OL,16,Fposted a song for the club, which has
OL,17,Fracked up more than 190,000 views on
OL,18,FTikTok.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
